Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:52:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/22] test(m3-march): add the ray-dump interface and the R04
 test builds

- change: tests/ray_dump.c traces a given (x^mu, k_mu) state with integrate_geodesic_state and returns the stored (x, k, |h|) per state, the terminal state and its end class; library entry for ccall plus a binary-dump CLI; raptor_camera_state exposes initialize_photon
- change: tests/build_tests.sh also builds the upstream-CKS metric probe (a = 0.9375) and the ray-dump libraries (SKS M2a, SKS M2b, CKS)
- change: model/blp_analytic/model.c takes the global spin from BLP_ANALYTIC_SPIN (CKS reference builds)
- next: fails to link until integrate_geodesic_state (M3) exists
---
 model/blp_analytic/model.c |  5 ++-
 tests/build_tests.sh       | 34 ++++++++++++++----
 tests/ray_dump.c           | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 104 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/ray_dump.c

